<section xid="34" props="page-margin-footer:0.5in; page-margin-header:0.5in">
<p style="Normal" xid="35" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c># Minutes of the MMU Website Redesign Meeting</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="314" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>**Date:** September 23, 2023  </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="315" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>**Time:** 10:00 AM - 12:00 PM  </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="316" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>**Venue:** Serena Hotel, Kampala</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="317" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="318" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>**Present:**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="319" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>1. John Smith - Chairperson</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="320" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>2. Jane Doe - Project Manager</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="321" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>3. Mark Johnson - Web Developer</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="322" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>4. Emily White - Graphic Designer</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="323" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>5. Sarah Brown - Content Writer</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="324" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>6. David Lee - Marketing Specialist</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="325" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>7. Michael Taylor - IT Support</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="326" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>8. Alice Clark - User Experience (UX) Designer</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="327" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="328" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>**Apologies:**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="329" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>1. Mary Johnson - Vice Chairperson (Apology received)</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="330" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>2. Paul Anderson - SEO Specialist (Apology received)</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="331" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>3. Lisa Green - Public Relations Officer (Apology received)</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="332" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="333" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>**Agenda:**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="334" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="335" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>1. **Opening Remarks**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="336" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - The meeting was called to order by Chairperson John Smith at 10:00 AM.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="337" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="338" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>2. **Approval of Previous Minutes**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="339" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - The minutes from the previous meeting held on September 15, 2023, were reviewed and approved without amendments.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="340" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="341" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>3. **Website Redesign Overview**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="342" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - Project Manager Jane Doe provided an overview of the MMU website redesign project, highlighting its goals and objectives.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="343" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="344" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>4. **Team Roles and Responsibilities**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="345" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - Each team member briefly discussed their respective roles and responsibilities in the redesign project.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="346" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="347" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>5. **Project Timeline**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="348" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - Project Manager Jane Doe presented the project timeline, including key milestones and deadlines.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="349" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="350" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>6. **Website Redesign Scope**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="351" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - Web Developer Mark Johnson presented the scope of work for the website redesign, emphasizing the technical aspects.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="352" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="353" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>7. **Design and User Experience (UX)**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="354" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - Graphic Designer Emily White and UX Designer Alice Clark discussed the design concepts and user experience improvements.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="355" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="356" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>8. **Content Strategy**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="357" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - Content Writer Sarah Brown presented the content strategy, including content creation and migration plans.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="358" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="359" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>9. **Marketing and Promotion**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="360" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>   - Marketing Specialist David Lee outlined the marketing and promotion strategies to ensure a successful website launch.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="361" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="362" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>10. **SEO Strategy**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="363" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>    - SEO Specialist Paul Anderson's absence was noted, and his input on the SEO strategy will be obtained separately.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="364" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="365" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>11. **IT Support and Technical Requirements**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="366" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>    - IT Support Michael Taylor discussed the technical requirements and support needed during the redesign process.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="367" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="368" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>12. **Next Steps**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="369" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>    - Chairperson John Smith summarized the discussion and outlined the next steps, including the need for regular progress updates and coordination among team members.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="370" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="371" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>13. **Any Other Business**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="372" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>    - None discussed.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="373" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="374" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>14. **Adjournment**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="375" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>    - The meeting was adjourned by Chairperson John Smith at 12:00 PM.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="376" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="377" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>**Action Items:**</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="378" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>- All team members are requested to review the project timeline and confirm their availability for upcoming tasks.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="379" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>- SEO Specialist Paul Anderson is to provide input on the SEO strategy within the next three days.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="380" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>- The project manager will circulate meeting minutes and relevant documents within 24 hours for reference.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="381" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="382" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>**Next Meeting:** The next meeting is scheduled for October 5, 2023, at 10:00 AM at the same venue.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="383" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="384" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>Respectfully submitted,</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="385" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>[Your Name]</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="386" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>[Your Title]</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="387" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>[Date]</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="388" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="389" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c>[End of Minutes]</c></p>
</section>
